{"ID":"20230928084807-n1hshib","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20230928084807-n1hshib","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084807-n1hshib\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084811-m7qw20i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085001-8dfki29\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084821-of36qbl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【足阳明胃经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173401"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912164806-96bu91z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912164806-96bu91z","updated":"20240912173339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【足阳明胃经穴位】：承泣穴、四白穴、巨髎穴、地仓穴、大迎穴、颊车穴、下关穴、头维穴、人迎穴、水突穴、气舍穴、缺盆穴、气户穴、库房穴、屋翳穴、膺窗穴、乳中穴、乳根穴、不容穴、承满穴、梁门穴、关门穴、太乙穴、滑肉门穴、天枢穴、外陵穴、大巨穴、水道穴、归来穴、气冲穴、髀关穴、伏兔穴、阴市穴、梁丘穴、犊鼻穴、足三里穴、上巨虚穴、条口穴、下巨虚穴、丰隆穴、解溪穴、冲阳穴、陷谷穴、内庭穴、厉兑穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928084811-m7qw20i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084811-m7qw20i","updated":"20230928084813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃是仓禀之官，五味出焉，胃是黄肠；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084811-bxdgoev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084811-bxdgoev","updated":"20230928084814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"木（酸）、火（苦）、土（甘）、金（辛）、水（咸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084811-kpbswd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084811-kpbswd6","updated":"20230928084815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天然的酸味都是碱性的，而食物腐烂产生的酸味则有毒；同样的酸味，对身体是好还是坏，胃可以分辨出来，所以称之为仓禀之官；（仓禀之官，可以理解为，仓管，把入口的食物进行分类，对身体无益的食物进行排掉，有益的保留）"}]},{"ID":"20230928084812-y1jjklq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084812-y1jjklq"}},{"ID":"20230928084820-6a3ohpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-6a3ohpy","updated":"20230928084935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t金\t历兑穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084820-veub2fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-veub2fu","updated":"20230928084935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t水\t内庭穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084820-hirdwp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-hirdwp2","updated":"20230928084936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t木\t陷谷穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084820-6wodjuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-6wodjuy","updated":"20230928084937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t火\t解溪穴\t母穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084820-5h0ksvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-5h0ksvj","updated":"20230928084937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t土\t足三里"}]},{"ID":"20230928084929-wsl267m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084929-wsl267m"}},{"ID":"20230928084820-qcyf9ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-qcyf9ft","updated":"20231016143559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"梁丘穴：足阳明胃经的郄穴；消炎、伤处红肿都可用；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084820-d13jrs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084820-d13jrs1","updated":"20230928084938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"足阳明胃经有四十五穴："}]},{"ID":"20230928084821-of36qbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084821-of36qbl"}},{"ID":"20230928084822-4tqiop2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084822-4tqiop2"}},{"ID":"20230928084939-4oi3tca","Type":"NodePa